      "solution": "1. Run `git --version`.\n2. Run `git config --global user.name \"Alex Contoso\"` and `git config --global user.email \"alex@contoso.example\"`.\n3. Run `git clone https://github.com/contoso-labs/inventory-api.git`, `cd inventory-api`, and `git status`.\n4. Run `git switch -c feature/health-endpoint`.\n5. Run `mkdir -p docs` and `echo \"Health endpoint notes\" > docs/health.md`.\n6. Run `git add docs/health.md`, `git commit -m \"Add health endpoint notes\"`, and `git log --oneline`.\n7. Run `git push -u origin feature/health-endpoint`.\n8. Select **Compare & pull request**, complete the form, and select **Create Pull Request**.\n9. Open the pull request from **Pull requests** and select **Reply and resolve review comment** after confirming the `/healthz` note."
